This directory contains SpiderMonkey 128.

This release is based on a revision of Mozilla 128:
  https://hg.mozilla.org/releases/

See https://github.com/ptomato/mozjs for a patched source tree which will build
from git.

Patches:
  https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1783570
  https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1907001

See https://spidermonkey.dev/ for documentation, examples, and release notes.
